repository-code: "https://github.com/wilmerhenao/return-path-peer-retrieval"
url: "https://github.com/wilmerhenao/return-path-peer-retrieval"
abstract: >-
  Research code for When Text Complements the Return Path: A Strong Baseline
  for Behavioral Equity-Peer Retrieval, accepted at ICAIF 2026. This source
  release includes return-window construction, Fama-French five-factor
  residualization, a positive-correlation NDCG metric, vintage Item 1
  extraction, historical TF-IDF and rank-blend selection, selected
  diagnostics, and tests. It excludes market data, filing corpora, model
  weights, embedding caches, saved results, and some reported analysis
  runners. The README describes the included code and missing dependencies.
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - "equity peer retrieval"
  - "residual return paths"
  - "filing text"
  - "TF-IDF"
  - "NDCG"
